# kv-push — service definitions
# One service per line:  name|url|category
#
#   url        http(s)://…  → status-code check (2xx-6xx counts as answering)
#              tcp://host:port → TCP port check, for anything without HTTP
#   category   free-form label your dashboard groups by (infra, apps,
#              monitoring, storage…)
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.

Reverse proxy|https://traefik.example.lab|infra
DNS|http://10.0.0.10:5380|infra
Internal CA|https://10.0.0.11:443/health|infra
Forge|https://forge.example.lab|infra
SSO|https://sso.example.lab|infra

Wiki|https://wiki.example.lab|apps
Media|https://media.example.lab|apps
Notes|http://10.0.0.30:22300|apps

Metrics|https://metrics.example.lab|monitoring
Logs|http://10.0.0.40:3100/ready|monitoring
SIEM|https://siem.example.lab|monitoring

Backup server|https://10.0.0.50:8007|storage
File share|tcp://10.0.0.51:445|storage
